  "body": "### Issue\n\nI started 'aider' with \r\n\r\naider --max-chat-history-tokens **_8192_**\r\n\r\nand \r\n\r\n/tokens \r\n\r\nshows\r\n\r\n$ 0.0323   **_10,783_** chat history                                                              use /clear to clear\r\n\r\nP.S - Claude Sonnet is the best model for me but is expensive. I tracked the ever growing  chat history  as one of the main culprits of the high costs with sonnet so I added  --max-chat-history-tokens **_8192_** to limit the history.\r\nHowever I find the chat history more than the limit I gave it.\n\n### Version and model info\n\nLatest version of aider with Claude sonnet",
